  "summary_en": "WAM news report on a new Sharjah law regulating all civil drones in the emirate. It sets permits, registration, pilot licensing, airspace zoning and oversight by the Sharjah Department of Civil Aviation and Sharjah Police, while supporting drone innovation and positioning Sharjah as a regional drone hub.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Applies to all drones in Sharjah including free zones; excludes military and security drones.",
   "Prior approval from Sharjah Department of Civil Aviation required for government, commercial, research and recreational use.",
   "Drone owners must register aircraft and display identification marks.",
   "Department defines airspace, flight corridors, restricted zones and licenses pilots and safety assessors.",
   "Sharjah Police handle drone-related offences; law also promotes drone innovation and localisation."
